project: Fortran Neural Network
summary: Neural network library implemented in modern Fortran.
version: @NN_VERSION@
author: Fortran-Neural-Network project
license: MIT
src_dir: ../src
output_dir: ../build/docs
exclude_dir: ../tests ../build
extensions: f90
graph: true
search: true

> **AI Generated**
>
> FORD configuration template for the Fortran Neural Network library.
> `make docs` substitutes the version placeholder on the `version:` key
> above with the contents of the VERSION file at the repo root, writes the
> result to `build/ford.md`, and runs FORD on it. Output is written to
> `build/docs/` (never committed).
>
> Note: FORD parses the `key: value` block above with the Markdown "meta"
> extension, which only reads leading key/value lines; `#` comment lines
> are not supported in this block, hence this file carries the mandatory
> AI-generated marker as the first body line instead.
>
> Note: the paths above (`src_dir`, `output_dir`, `exclude_dir`) are
> relative to `build/`, because the rendered configuration lives in
> `build/ford.md`.
